# Affix stats count on the character (m2-affix-loot task 4.1d). Needs Arpgtest online (held by the headless client).
# ".arpg test equip/unequip" measure the character's real stat change (flat main stats, rating fields) and compare it
# with the expected change (item template stats + its affix lines). match=yes = exact.
# Items: 82437 epic robe (req 90, chest slot 4), 1489 blue chest (req 16).

> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 90 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
# Start with an empty chest slot (a previous run may have left a robe on).
> .arpg test unequip Arpgtest 4
? ok unequipped|slot empty
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok

# Level 90: values are far above any native enchant, so mod_arpg applies them.
> .arpg test equip Arpgtest 82437
? ok equipped item=82437 .*affixes=[345]\b.* match=yes
> .arpg loot applied Arpgtest
? applied items=[01]\b

# Relog (task 5.2): item mods off, the affix cache re-read from the database, item mods on (the login path) - same stats.
> .arpg test relog Arpgtest
? ok relog affixed_equipped=[01] removed=[1-9]\d* match=yes

# Swap for another rolled robe: the old robe's affixes come off, the new ones go on.
> .arpg test equip Arpgtest 82437
? match=yes
> .arpg loot applied Arpgtest
? applied items=[01]\b

# Unequip: everything comes off.
> .arpg test unequip Arpgtest 4
? ok unequipped .* match=yes
> .arpg loot applied Arpgtest
? applied items=0

# Low level: small values are mostly shown by native enchant slots (core applies those); still exact.
> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
> .arpg test equip Arpgtest 1489
? ok equipped item=1489 .* match=yes
> .arpg test unequip Arpgtest 4
? match=yes
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok

# A main-hand weapon keeps its tooltip lines when unequipped (owner 2026-11-27: a Night Elf Paladin's daggers lost their
# affix lines after a few swaps - the core cleared two of the slots holding them; disabled, and logins repair old items).
# 4454 Talon of Vultros (blue one-hand dagger, req 11) goes into the main hand (slot 15).
> .arpg test unequip Arpgtest 15
? ok unequipped|slot empty
> .arpg test equip Arpgtest 4454
? ok equipped item=4454 .*affixes=[1-9]
> .arpg test unequip Arpgtest 15
? ok unequipped guid=\d+ slot=15 lines_before=([1-9]) lines_after=\1\b
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
